    "blokken": [
      "Home",
      "Knowledge base",
      "Knowledge base",
      "AI Knowledge Base for Business Leaders | Freelance AI Consultant",
      "This AI knowledge base covers practical explanations of AI for business: what a term means, how to approach something, and what to watch for. Written plainly, without hype, for anyone who needs to make a decision or run a project.",
      "See the AI Readiness Assessment → Book a strategy call →",
      "Written by Dave Willemstein, independent AI consultant · published October 27, 2026",
      "IN SHORT",
      "Evergreen explanations and how-tos on AI for business.",
      "Six topics, from strategy to tools.",
      "Opinion and thought leadership live separately, in Insights.",
